<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Denko suspended pending news.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Denko suspended pending news.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Denko Industrial Corp Bhd were suspended from Friday afternoon trading pending a news announcement, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official said.</p>
<p>The stock ended the morning session unchanged at 17.70 ringgit on volume of 469,000 traded.  </p>
<p>The exchange official said the company requested for the stock's suspension.</p>
<p>Officials at Denko, a manufacturer of electronic and metal parts, were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
